title: The Chancellor's Protégé
subtitle: Palpatine has taken an interest in young Skywalker.
tags: event
view-if: date >= 48 and anakin_found and (pal_chancellor or pal_r >= 6)
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_jedi.svg
on-arrival: anakin_fall += 1

= The Chancellor's Protégé

Anakin Skywalker, now a teenage Padawan, has become a frequent guest of [? if pal_chancellor : the Supreme Chancellor ?][? if not pal_chancellor : Senator Palpatine ?]. Palpatine praises his gifts, sympathises with his frustrations at the Jedi's rules, and tells him he will one day be the most powerful Jedi of all. The boy adores him.

- @warn: Quietly warn the Jedi that this friendship is unhealthy.
- @encourage: It is touching. Encourage it.
- @nothing: It is none of the Caucus's business.

@warn
subtitle: [? if jedi_relation >= 55 : The Jedi trust us enough to listen. ?][? if jedi_relation < 55 : The Jedi may not listen. ?]
on-arrival: jedi_relation += 2; anakin_fall -= 0.8 if jedi_relation >= 55; jedi_suspicion += 0.3

[? if jedi_relation >= 55 : Obi-Wan Kenobi thanks us, and makes sure his apprentice spends more time at the Temple. ?][? if jedi_relation < 55 : The Council thanks us politely, and does nothing. ?]

@encourage
subtitle: The Chancellor's allies appreciate it.
on-arrival: pal_relation += 4; anakin_fall += 0.5

The Caucus thinks no more about it.

@nothing

The visits continue.
